This package bundles a snapshot of the FORRT Replication Database (FReD), file
data/flora-replications.json (shipped as dist/data/flora-replications.json):

  FORRT. FReD: the FORRT Replication Database.
  https://github.com/forrtproject/FReD-data
  DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/9R62X
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The snapshot was converted from the database's CSV export into the JSON index this
library reads (replications grouped by original DOI). If you show results derived from
it, credit FReD as above.
